usage: sdk_script.py [-h]
                     [--problem_statement PROBLEM_STATEMENT | --problem_statement_file PROBLEM_STATEMENT_FILE]
                     --cwd CWD [--base_commit BASE_COMMIT] [--init]
                     [--log_path LOG_PATH] [--output_dir OUTPUT_DIR]
                     [--resume_session_id RESUME_SESSION_ID] [--fork_session]
                     [--extra_message EXTRA_MESSAGE | --extra_message_file EXTRA_MESSAGE_FILE]

Claude Code SDK Quick Start

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
  --problem_statement PROBLEM_STATEMENT
                        问题描述(首轮必填;resume 时可省略)
  --problem_statement_file PROBLEM_STATEMENT_FILE
                        UTF-8 file containing the complete problem statement
  --cwd CWD             工作目录
  --base_commit BASE_COMMIT
                        基础 commit(resume 时用于兜底生成累积 patch)
  --init                先执行 /init 初始化项目上下文
  --log_path LOG_PATH   日志文件路径
  --output_dir OUTPUT_DIR
                        输出目录
  --resume_session_id RESUME_SESSION_ID
                        恢复指定会话继续对话(多轮反馈 loop 使用)
  --fork_session        配合 --resume_session_id,分叉出新会话而不污染原会话
  --extra_message EXTRA_MESSAGE
                        resume 时发送的额外消息(即 reviewer hint)
  --extra_message_file EXTRA_MESSAGE_FILE
                        UTF-8 file containing the complete resume message
